  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following equations :<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>xA</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>yB</mi></math></p><p>(in basic medium)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math></p><p>(in acidic medium)</p><p>The sum of the stoichiometric coefficients <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;for products <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>&nbsp;respectively, is _______</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "19",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>(i)&#160;&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext>OH</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>So sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
